  "sourceTitle": "Lemon Loaf",
  "sourceText": "Lemon Loaf\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Tuesday, December 8, 2009 - 11:25pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 box Betty Crocker lemon cake mix\n1 box lemon Jello\n3/4 cup Mazola oil\n3/4 cup apricot nectar\n2 teaspoons lemon juice\n4 eggs, add one at a time and beat real well\n1/2 box powdered sugar\nLemon juice to spread\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Bake in bundt pan at 350 degrees for 45 minutes. 2 Ice cake while hot.",
